Implement the assigned task in {{inputs.worktreePath}}.
Task ID: {{inputs.taskId}}
Specification:
{{inputs.taskSpec}}
Scope hints:
- Crate: {{inputs.crate}}
- Relevant files: {{inputs.filePaths}}
Requirements:
- Keep changes focused and production-ready.
- Follow existing codebase patterns.
- Run only scoped verification needed for implementation confidence.
- Do not touch git.
When finished, summarize what changed and what you verified.

Review the predecessor context and the current worktree for task {{inputs.taskId}}.
Worktree: {{inputs.worktreePath}}
Crate: {{inputs.crate}}
Relevant files: {{inputs.filePaths}}
Run focused build/test verification for the implemented change.
Return ONLY valid JSON in this shape:
{"verdict":"PASS"|"FAIL","summary":"...","findings":["..."],"commands":["..."]}
Mark PASS only when scoped verification succeeds and no blocking defects remain.

Use the predecessor context from blue-team to fix the reported issues for task {{inputs.taskId}}.
Worktree: {{inputs.worktreePath}}
Crate: {{inputs.crate}}
Relevant files: {{inputs.filePaths}}
Address every blocking finding, keep the fix minimal, run scoped verification, and summarize the remediation work.
Do not touch git.

Re-verify the remediated implementation for task {{inputs.taskId}} using predecessor context and the current worktree.
Worktree: {{inputs.worktreePath}}
Crate: {{inputs.crate}}
Relevant files: {{inputs.filePaths}}
